# Wrangler reads this from the assets directory (= repo root, per the registry deploy entry).
# The publish procedure in DEPLOY.md writes its own copy into a temp staging dir; this one
# exists so the guard is STRUCTURAL rather than procedural — a plain `wrangler deploy` from
# the repo root must not put internal documents on the client's public domain.
# DEPLOY.md was published to oudkempeneetcafe.nl once. Do not remove this file.
*.md
.assetsignore
